      "writtenOn": "2020-08-03T16:29:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Quite a few TCPMv2 changes have gone in that change the order things are being processed. My theory is the AutoDischargeDisconnect was still being left enabled in 13310 and that would latch Vbus into continuing to provide power. This would allow us to get to the system_reset and we would look like we did the right thing when in fact we didn\u0027t brown out.",
