      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-03T16:15:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The paths that we do not brown out (battery present), we will go through restart_tc_sm to start back up and this will call init to set the value back to enabled and we will start as expected",
      "parentUuid": "8245b551_e62f8f1a",
